Package: knapsack
Type: Package
Title: Brute-Force, Dynamic-Programming and Greedy Knapsack Solvers
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2021-10-21
Authors@R: c(
    person("Raja Uzair", "Saeed", email = "rajsa233@student.liu.se", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Daniel", "Persson", email = "danpe586@student.liu.se", role = "aut"))
Description: Solves the 0/1 knapsack problem with three algorithms - exhaustive
    brute force (optionally parallelised), dynamic programming and a greedy
    approximation - and compares their run time with profiling.
